  "description": "‘Former Child Actor Seo Yoon-seo Comes Out?!’\n\nThat single rumor completely shattered Yoon-seo’s life.\nAs the rumors spiraled further and further out of control,\ncastings were canceled,\nbillboards were torn down,\nand his ruined image\neven led to lawsuits for damages.\n\nJust as he reached a dead end with absolutely nowhere left to run—\nHe met the man who would shake up his life once again:\nChoi Do-young.\n\n“When you make a face like that, Seo Yoon-seo, it makes me feel like a total bastard.”\n\n“D-Director... wait a minute.”\n\n“You shouldn't treat the great Choi Do-young like a dog, now should you?”\n\nEyes drenched in desire gleamed intensely.\nEven without him going this far, Yoon-seo already knew that the man coveting him was none other than Choi Do-young.\n\n“Seo Yoon-seo.”\n\nA husky, low voice pierced his eardrums.\n\n“Let go. Before you get hurt.”\n\n**Original Webtoon:**   \n[Ridibooks](https://ridibooks.com/books/5285002443), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=14384328), [Bomtoon](https://www.bomtoon.com/detail/metatoon132), [Lezhin](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/untieme_before_hurt), [MrBlue](https://www.mrblue.com/webtoon/wt_000080025)",
